WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
Parenthood changes the way
you listen to the night.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:08.980
Every rustle, every pause,
every quiet moment

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:12.000
can leave you wondering
if everything is okay.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.110
After the last feeding,
one more cuddle,

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:19.000
and a final check,
you want to rest too.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Through the night, SightAware helps you see
when your baby's skin temperature shifts,

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.000
so you can decide when
it may be time to check in.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.000
If the skin temperature shifts
outside of your set comfort threshold,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.800
your screen will light up
and you will receive an audible alert

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.000
letting you know
you should take action.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
No wearables, no WiFi,
no subscription.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.500
Just calm, contactless awareness
from a monitor designed

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:48.000
to let your baby
simply sleep.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.000
And when morning comes,
you can return to what matters most.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.000
SightAware by Nonnanest,
a quieter kind of baby monitor.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Peace of mind, made simple.
